  "description": "AWS Braket plugin for FSharp.Azure.Quantum. Submits circuits to Braket gate QPUs (IonQ, Rigetti, IQM, OQC, Infleqtion) and simulators (SV1/DM1/TN1) via OpenQASM 3.0, and neutral-atom analog programs to QuEra Aquila via the Braket AHS format. This is the only package that depends on the AWS SDK — the core FSharp.Azure.Quantum package stays AWS-free. Requires FSharp.Azure.Quantum.",
